{"title":"Mothsilk Legs","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Crafted (Tailoring Lv 52) · Monster drop: Mountain Ogre, Old Mother Ashka, Selene, Mother Of Moths, Ogre Mauler, Ogre Charger</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      <p><b>Crafted</b> with Tailoring at level 52 <span class=\"muted\">(6234 XP)</span> from 2× <a href=\"#/item/moth-silk\">Moth Silk</a>, 8× <a href=\"#/item/wool\">Wool</a>.</p>\n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"moon-mother\" title=\"Selene, Mother Of Moths - dropped it in 1 of 7 looted corpses (1/7)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/7c86cf4529db3a6a02f0.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Selene, Mother Of Moths</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/7<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-firespeaker\" title=\"Old Mother Ashka - dropped it in 1 of 121 looted corpses (1/121)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/c9d4aa1be4f688f3b580.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Old Mother Ashka</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/121<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-mountain\" title=\"Mountain Ogre - dropped it in 1 of 612 looted corpses (1/612)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/fe10b0281fa1b1c70ebf.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Mountain Ogre</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/612<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-mauler\" title=\"Ogre Mauler - dropped it in 1 of 709 looted corpses (1/709)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/75903b759d1521edd876.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogre Mauler</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/709<br>×1</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+1 more\">+1 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-charger\" title=\"Ogre Charger - dropped it in 1 of 2,000 looted corpses (1/2,000)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/253503604ab2f59ece68.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogre Charger</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/2,000<br>×1</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"mothsilk-legs\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/tailoring\">Tailoring</a></p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p class=\"rel-row\"><b>Made from</b> <a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/moth-silk\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/0d15d8530734f756ad4c.svg\" alt=\"\">Moth Silk</a><a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/wool\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/e1728324d6942e9b4191.svg\" alt=\"\">Wool</a></p>\n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/gen/dd5a2f71e167f9f9ebea.svg\" alt=\"Mothsilk Legs\"></div><h3>Mothsilk Legs</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Made with</th><td>Tailoring 52</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Dropped by</th><td>5 monsters</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Last seen</th><td>10/30/2026, 9:41:12 PM</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}